But first, I do wanna snag a quick moment

1414
01:06:31.770 --> 01:06:33.700
to talk about something I care a lot about,

1415
01:06:33.700 --> 01:06:35.990
which is the importance of nutrition.

1416
01:06:35.990 --> 01:06:38.370
And the thing is most people I know

1417
01:06:38.370 --> 01:06:40.460
actually aspire to eat better,

1418
01:06:40.460 --> 01:06:42.430
to incorporate more whole plants,

1419
01:06:42.430 --> 01:06:45.370
fruits, vegetables, seeds, beans and legumes

1420
01:06:45.370 --> 01:06:46.940
into their daily regimen.

1421
